                              |GKBTIGER MIND
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'The stalking Tiger on his trail is not easily distracted.'|WKO -
|RKBMaster Kung Lo|YK0

A Monk who is one with the Tiger is as strong in mind as they
are in body. The mind of a Tiger is like a steel cage, protected
from outside attack. A wise Monk uses this technique to combat
others invading their minds.

|YK0This is a Master of Autumn power.

